  "description": "Remove editing instructions and rhetorical flourishes from public copy, clarify the included study designs, and qualify interpretations of null results and mechanisms. Numerical estimates, sample definitions, source references, and source-review statuses are unchanged. Exact notes-only corrections are recorded separately from source verification.",
